# No key is needed for default Ollaya CLI. This file is a template, NOT auto-loaded.
# Export credentials only for the provider you explicitly select.
# Direct Jev (--provider jev), never passed to Git/test/Ollaya children:
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Optional: an alias for the same key.
# JEV_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter (--provider openrouter) uses only its own key, not the TypeSafe key.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: a local gateway shim speaking the direct wire format.
# JEV_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4322

# Optional: plain text report, no color and no spinner.
# NO_COLOR=1
